   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "您好！建議您看一下SSlogis函數的on-line documentation中範例，轉貼於下。<div><br></div><div><div>Chick.1 &lt;- ChickWeight[ChickWeight$Chick == 1, ]</div><div>Chick.1</div><div>SSlogis(Chick.1$Time, 368, 14, 6)  # response only</div><div>Asym &lt;- 368; xmid &lt;- 14; scal &lt;- 6</div><div>SSlogis(Chick.1$Time, Asym, xmid, scal) # response and gradient</div><div>getInitial(weight ~ SSlogis(Time, Asym, xmid, scal), data = Chick.1)</div><div>## Initial values are in fact the converged values</div><div>fm1 &lt;- nls(weight ~ SSlogis(Time, Asym, xmid, scal), data = Chick.1)</div><div>summary(fm1)</div></div>"
    ],
